**H2: The Speed Trap: Why AI-Accelerated Development Needs Old-School Discipline**

Section note: Underserved angle in business AI content. AI coding agents optimize for working code, not secure code. The decades of security practices (code reviews, authentication standards, security scans) did not become optional because development is faster. In fact, they are more critical because the surface area expands faster.

- H3: What coding agents do not know about your security posture
  Section note: The hardcoded credential scenario. AI agents will choose the path of least friction. That path is not always the secure path. [GAP -- confirm whether this is a real client incident or a constructed example. If real, name the category of breach without specifics.]
